description "Jek Tono Porkins aka 'Piggy'

I'm a big man. A big, BIG man.

^2Weaponry:
- Meathooks (Wookiee-style Melee)
-- Drains on hit
-- 200% more damage
-- 90% more knockback
-- 15% slower RoF
- Emergency Eject (6) (IHR)
-- Trips/pushes/lifts/burns on det
-- 300% more damage
-- 25% larger splash
-- 100% less velocity
-- Secondary fire only
- CR-1 Blast Cannon (Shotgun 3)
-- 10% more velocity
-- 10% more damage/FP damage
-- 100% slower reload
-- Primary fire only
- Thermal Imploders (3) (Frags)
-- Pulls on det
- Porkins' S3 Blaster Pistol (EE-3 1)
-- 75% faster RoF
-- 30% less damage
-- 20% less FP damage
-- 100% slower reload

^6Inventory:
- Defense Seeker ^3[CS1]
- Medpac ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Brawler Guard
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Healing (1)
- Recharge (1)
- 25% more knockback given
- 50% less knockback taken
- 25% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Wrecking Ball (Barge 1) ^3[Melee CS2]"